      "uid": "zhcn:2d9eefb7b118415579bada2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许是因为对美浦波旁抱有憧憬，\n让她开始不满意自己的现状了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae4c93acccb2308709b217110278fa50a6d8df97f02ac4fffcde246d38c44c43",
